### ========================================
### ORDER MANAGEMENT - DISCOUNT COMPARISON
### ========================================

### 18. Create Order - Best Discount Selection
# Volume: 10 units = 20% discount
# Promotional: Black Friday = 25% discount (if active)
# System should apply Black Friday (higher discount)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "695a5c9c79b4b500ad27dcb1",
    "products": [
        {
            "productId": "695a5c9379b4b500ad27dca5",
            "quantity": 10
        }
    ]
}

### 19. Create Order - Volume vs Promotional
# Volume: 50 units = 30% discount
# Promotional: Holiday Sales = 15% discount (if active)
# System should apply Volume discount (higher)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "679a1234567890abcdef1234",
    "products": [
        {
            "productId": "695a56b20b95981883608cde",
            "quantity": 50
        }
    ]
}

