### ========================================
### ORDER RETRIEVAL
### ========================================

### 26. Get Order by ID
# Replace with actual order ID from previous responses
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/679a1234567890abcdef1234

### 27. Get Order by ID - Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/000000000000000000000000

### ========================================
### RACE CONDITION TESTING
### ========================================

### 28. Concurrent Order Test - Request 1
# Create a product with stock=10, then run this with request 29 simultaneously
# Both orders request 8 items. Only one should succeed.
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "679a1234567890abcdef1234",
    "products": [
        {
            "productId": "695a56b20b95981883608cde",
            "quantity": 8
        }
    ]
}

### 29. Concurrent Order Test - Request 2
# Run simultaneously with request 28
# One should succeed, one should fail with insufficient stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "679a1234567890abcdef5678",
    "products": [
        {
            "productId": "695a56b20b95981883608cde",
            "quantity": 8
        }
    ]
}

### ========================================
### COMPLEX SCENARIOS
### ========================================

### 30. Create Order - Europe Customer + Volume Discount
# Location: +15% pricing
# Volume: 10 units = 20% discount
# Discount applies AFTER location pricing
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "679a1234567890abcdef5678",
    "products": [
        {
            "productId": "695a56b20b95981883608cde",
            "quantity": 10
        }
    ]
}

### 31. Create Order - Asia Customer + Promotional Discount
# Location: -5% pricing
# Promotional: 15% discount (if active)
# Discount applies AFTER location pricing
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "679a1234567890abcdef9abc",
    "products": [
        {
            "productId": "695a56b20b95981883608cde",
            "quantity": 3
        }
    ]
}

### 32. Create Order - Large Multi-Product Order
# Multiple products, high volume, complex pricing
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "customerId": "679a1234567890abcdef1234",
    "products": [
        {
            "productId": "695a56b20b95981883608cde",
            "quantity": 20
        },
        {
            "productId": "695a56b20b95981883608cdf",
            "quantity": 15
        },
        {
            "productId": "695a56b20b95981883608ce0",
            "quantity": 25
        }
    ]
}

### ========================================
### VERIFICATION WORKFLOW
### ========================================

### 33. Verify Stock After Order
# After creating an order, check product stock to verify it was decremented
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/695a56b20b95981883608cde

### 34. Verify Order Details
# Check complete order details including pricing breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/695a637f9e2fa2b922b1394d

